check 1
# Ground items, many classes and qualities (area G, drops): seeds fixed, then at frame 4 forty items made through the game's own creation path;
# the item seeds, classes and places are compared frame by frame (equal item seeds mean the same RNG draws).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md, specs/tools/poke.md.
# Result (2026-10-09, 36 items made on both sides): quality, item level,
# affix ids (magic, rare, auto), item seeds, start seed and the item stat
# lists are EQUAL on every item. Two fields differ for every poked item and
# are ignored here until the binary question is answered
# (docs/handoff/pc1-data.md Step 4 item 26): item flag 0x2000 (1.14d clear,
# d2rs set per generation.md §3 step 5) and the file index of items without
# one (1.14d 0, d2rs -1).
ignore if fi
name items-ground-many
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 240
channels state
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke item hax @x+2 @y quality magic ilvl 20
at 4 poke item 2ax @x+3 @y quality rare ilvl 35
at 4 poke item bsw @x+4 @y quality unique ilvl 40
at 4 poke item lsd @x+5 @y quality set ilvl 40
at 4 poke item glv @x+6 @y quality rare ilvl 50
at 4 poke item jav @x+7 @y quality magic ilvl 60
at 4 poke item 9ar @x+8 @y quality unique ilvl 75
at 4 poke item ful @x+9 @y quality magic ilvl 30
at 4 poke item plt @x+2 @y+2 quality rare ilvl 55
at 4 poke item lg2 @x+3 @y+2 quality set ilvl 40
at 4 poke item rin @x+4 @y+2 quality rare ilvl 60
at 4 poke item amu @x+5 @y+2 quality unique ilvl 60
at 4 poke item jew @x+6 @y+2 quality rare ilvl 70
at 4 poke item cm1 @x+7 @y+2 quality magic ilvl 30
at 4 poke item cm2 @x+8 @y+2 quality magic ilvl 60
at 4 poke item cm3 @x+9 @y+2 quality unique ilvl 80
at 4 poke item mbl @x+2 @y+4 quality magic ilvl 45
at 4 poke item vbt @x+3 @y+4 quality rare ilvl 50
at 4 poke item hbt @x+4 @y+4 quality magic ilvl 30
at 4 poke item tbk @x+5 @y+4
at 4 poke item rvl @x+6 @y+4
at 4 poke item gsw @x+7 @y+4
at 4 poke item gzv @x+8 @y+4
at 4 poke item r10 @x+9 @y+4
at 4 poke item r30 @x+2 @y+6
at 4 poke item key @x+3 @y+6
