at 4 poke item hp5 @x+5 @y+6
at 4 poke item mp4 @x+6 @y+6
at 4 poke item axf @x+7 @y+6 quality rare ilvl 85
at 4 poke item buc @x+8 @y+6 quality magic ilvl 40
at 4 poke item sml @x+9 @y+6 quality magic ilvl 25
at 4 poke item pa6 @x+2 @y+8 quality set ilvl 50
